Realms replacement assets (this directory)

OpenFront's original proprietary assets (logo, wordmark, font, music, alert sound)
were removed from this fork; they are All Rights Reserved by OpenFront Inc. and are
not licensed for redistribution.

Files now in this directory were made for Realms by C.C. Terra & Fleet LLC and are
released under CC0 1.0 (public domain). The replacement font is DejaVu Sans Bold,
redistributed under the DejaVu Fonts License (Bitstream Vera + Arev public domain).
